## RelationType: 由…使能

来源 IRI：`https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/enabledBy`。来源定义：relation from one capability to another capability such that associated performance of the first capability is made possible by another。此 BKN 投影使用 `enabled_by_target_id` 保存目标实体 ID。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| capability | capability | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| enabled_by_target_id | entity_id |
